r character or destroy something nearby.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>10 Unique Veteran Soldiers and Unlimited Amount of Recruits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every veteran has their own unique appearance, backstory, character traits, abilities, catchphrases, their point of view on events in Africa and their squadmates.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5 Character Classes With Various Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic classes include: assault trooper, grenadier, machine gunner, sniper and specialist. Every class specializes in combat at their specific distance and serving their tactical roles. Every class has a unique set of abilities that you unlock while leveling, making a soldier more effective in the field.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Own Base of Operations That You Can Upgrade and Improve</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can build new blocks in the base to unlock additional gameplay features. Base is also where you hire new soldiers, manage rest and recovery of your squad.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Weaponry and Consumables</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The system of contracts allows you to buy new weapons and various gear: smoke grenades, flashbangs, personal medkits, mines, tasers, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intelligent Enemies of Various Classes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy class has their own artificial intelligence that dictates their combat tactic. Enemies possess many different abilities and use a variety of weapons. You have to adapt and use different tactics against each of the enemy classes. </p>",
